I don't mean to just ask you to do it cheerfully.

236
00:16:08,260 --> 00:16:11,580
I just want each of you to express yourselves in a way that makes people look forward.

237
00:16:11,580 --> 00:16:15,220
I want you to be able to push people's backs up, to rise high.

238
00:16:15,220 --> 00:16:18,800
I want you to sing the song "Jump" in such a way that you can push people's backs.

239
00:16:18,800 --> 00:16:22,480
We discussed over and over whether or not we could sing the song "Jump.

240
00:16:22,480 --> 00:16:25,840
After many discussions and arguments, we came up with a new form of "Jump" that we all created together.

241
00:16:25,840 --> 00:16:29,480
I think we all came up with this new form of "Jump".

242
00:16:34,340 --> 00:16:37,640
That's why it's here now.
